    "detailed_description": "Let's make takoyaki on the Steam!<br>Use your utensils well to make delicious takoyaki!<br>You can play with up to four players!<br>Reach for the ultimate high score!<br><br><br>Cook using a takoyaki-maker.<br>The points you earn depend on how well your takoyaki are cooked!<br>Make as much as you can before time runs out!<br><br><br>1. Fill the holes with batter and ingredients.<br><br>2. Once the takoyaki start to smoke, flip them over!<br>   If you're too fast or too slow, it's a flop!<br>   Once both sides are well cooked, finish by placing your takoyaki in the box!<br><br>[Score Attack]<br>Aim for 1st place on the leaderboards by making as much takoyaki as possible!<br><br>[Battle]<br>Test your takoyaki-making mettle against others!<br><br>*Controllers are required for multiplayer play.",
    "about_the_game": "Let's make takoyaki on the Steam!<br>Use your utensils well to make delicious takoyaki!<br>You can play with up to four players!<br>Reach for the ultimate high score!<br><br><br>Cook using a takoyaki-maker.<br>The points you earn depend on how well your takoyaki are cooked!<br>Make as much as you can before time runs out!<br><br><br>1. Fill the holes with batter and ingredients.<br><br>2. Once the takoyaki start to smoke, flip them over!<br>   If you're too fast or too slow, it's a flop!<br>   Once both sides are well cooked, finish by placing your takoyaki in the box!<br><br>[Score Attack]<br>Aim for 1st place on the leaderboards by making as much takoyaki as possible!<br><br>[Battle]<br>Test your takoyaki-making mettle against others!<br><br>*Controllers are required for multiplayer play.",
